, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "96c9eba5c1afdd18ebfc087783288e63b105ff32", "message": "docs: add example test using app fixture in FastAPI guide\n\nAdd a new section to the FastAPI testing guide that demonstrates \nhow to create a test using the app fixture. This enhances the \ndocumentation by providing a practical example for users, \nshowcasing how to verify the main endpoint's response and \nensure it matches the expected app name from settings.", "created_at": "2025-02-24T21:27:28Z", "repo": "getmarkus.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e660022b0c89ab37f069018e54770c9ec069fde3", "message": "Merge pull request #4 from getmarkus/cm-branch-2\n\nchore: update GitHub Actions workflow for deployment", "created_at": "2025-02-24T20:52:39Z", "repo": "getmarkus.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1b09a4539f47052d06a063b661b1e7e3ff8e7f68", "message": "chore: update GitHub Actions workflow for deployment\n\nRefactor the GitHub Actions workflow by updating the branch \nspecification format and upgrading action versions. Change the \nbranch format to remove spaces for consistency. Upgrade \n`actions/deploy-pages` to version 4, `actions/checkout` to \nversion 4, and `withastro/action` to version 2 to leverage \nnew features and improvements. Adjust the Node version in \ncomments to reflect the latest version.", "created_at": "2025-02-24T20:33:33Z", "repo": "getmarkus.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0111b1b200522a746d5e7253680ca178bcbfd22f", "message": "Merge pull request #3 from getmarkus/cm-branch-1\n\nfeat: update guides and add FastAPI testing section", "created_at": "2025-02-24T20:13:06Z", "repo": "getmarkus.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f654308a78f429c51d93e7fe2d7a277c1567474a", "message": "feat: update guides and add FastAPI testing section